cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Code and public data for: News-Derived versus Macro-Financial Signals"
license: MIT
abstract: "Code, public data and aggregate results for a study that forecasts whether foreign investors are net buyers or net sellers of Korean semiconductor stocks on the next trading day, and compares macro-financial variables, LDA news topics and LLM news sentiment as predictors across ten deep learning and tree models with SHAP-based explanations."
keywords:
  - foreign investor trading
  - stock direction prediction
  - Korean stock market
  - semiconductor industry
  - financial time series forecasting
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP
  - news sentiment analysis
  - LDA topic modeling
  - large language models
  - macro-financial variables
repository-code: "https://github.com/parkjohn10277/News-Derived-versus-Macro-Financial-Signals"
